h","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_25","text":"and I didn't know what to say,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_26","text":"so I quietly snuck out.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_27","text":"It's the first time I've seen her like that,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_28","text":"so I'm a little worried, that's all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_29","text":"That doesn't sound like her at all.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_30","text":"Exactly.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_31","text":"So I was thinking that","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_32","text":"we could maybe get her a gift of some kind.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_33","text":"Y'know,","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"vesti","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_34","text":"to help her lighten up a bit.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_35","text":"Oh my!","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_36","text":"That's a great idea.","jump":null},{"id":"m_ex_absolut_03_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"emma","key":"Locale_SuddenMessage:m_ex_absolut_03_37","text":"I've already got something in mind.","ju